{
  "key": 39268,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Hello...\n",
        "Lovely weather, isn’t it?\r",
        "It’s so pleasant...\n",
        "I’m afraid I might doze off...\r",
        "My name is Erika.\n",
        "I am the Leader of Celadon Gym.\r",
        "...Oh? You are from Johto, you say?\f",
        "How nice...\r",
        "Oh. I’m sorry, I didn’t realize that\n",
        "you wished to challenge me.\r",
        "I know.\r",
        "I have been training myself on\n",
        "not only flower arrangement\f",
        "but also Pokémon battle.\r",
        "I shall not lose.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh!\n",
        "I concede defeat...\r",
        "You are remarkably strong...\n",
        "I shall give you the Rainbow Badge...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Rainbow Badge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: That was a delightful match.\n",
        "I felt inspired.\r",
        "Please, I wish you to have this TM19\n",
        "as a special token.\r",
        "It is Giga Drain.\n",
        "It is a wonderful move that drains\f",
        "half the damage it inflicts to heal\f",
        "your Pokémon.\r",
        "It is indeed a horrifying move.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Losing leaves a\n",
        "bitter aftertaste...\r",
        "But knowing that there are strong\n",
        "Trainers spurs me to do better..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_00005",
      "en_US": "Celadon City Pokémon Gym"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0492_T07GYM0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon City Pokémon Gym\r",
        "Gym Leader: Erika\n",
        "Certified Trainer!\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
